blocks.context:
Design an intake workflow.
- Program and what it provides: {{PROGRAM_AND_WHAT_IT_PROVIDES}}
- Who we serve: {{WHO_WE_SERVE}}
- Eligibility criteria: {{ELIGIBILITY_CRITERIA}}
- Documentation required and by whom: {{DOCUMENTATION_REQUIRED_AND_BY_WHOM}}
- Systems we must enter data into: {{SYSTEMS_WE_MUST_ENTER_DATA_INTO}}
- Staff involved and their roles: {{STAFF_INVOLVED_AND_THEIR_ROLES}}
- Current pain points: {{CURRENT_PAIN_POINTS}}
- Target time from first contact to enrollment: {{TARGET_TIME_FROM_FIRST_CONTACT_TO_ENROLLMENT}}

Draft a progress report.
- Funder and grant number: {{FUNDER_AND_GRANT_NUMBER}}
- Reporting period: {{REPORTING_PERIOD}}
- Contracted targets: {{CONTRACTED_TARGETS}}
- Actual performance: {{ACTUAL_PERFORMANCE}}
- Reasons for any variance: {{REASONS_FOR_ANY_VARIANCE}}
- Corrective actions underway: {{CORRECTIVE_ACTIONS_UNDERWAY}}
- Narrative questions the funder asks: {{NARRATIVE_QUESTIONS_THE_FUNDER_ASKS}}
- Word or page limits: {{WORD_OR_PAGE_LIMITS}}

Draft a statement of need.
- Funder and program: {{FUNDER_AND_PROGRAM}}
- Exact prompt or question from the application: {{EXACT_PROMPT_OR_QUESTION_FROM_THE_APPLICATION}}
- Word or character limit: {{WORD_OR_CHARACTER_LIMIT}}
- Community or population served: {{COMMUNITY_OR_POPULATION_SERVED}}
- Data I have: {{DATA_I_HAVE}}
- What makes this need urgent now: {{WHAT_MAKES_THIS_NEED_URGENT_NOW}}
- The funder's stated priorities: {{THE_FUNDER_S_STATED_PRIORITIES}}

Draft formal minutes for this meeting.
- Governing body: {{GOVERNING_BODY}}
- Date, time, and location: {{DATE_TIME_AND_LOCATION}}
- Members present, absent, and any who arrived or left mid-meeting: {{MEMBERS_PRESENT_ABSENT_AND_ANY_WHO_ARRIVED_OR}}
- Staff and guests present: {{STAFF_AND_GUESTS_PRESENT}}
- Quorum requirement and whether it was met: {{QUORUM_REQUIREMENT_AND_WHETHER_IT_WAS_MET}}
- Notes or transcript from the meeting: {{NOTES_OR_TRANSCRIPT_FROM_THE_MEETING}}

Draft the program design section.
- Funding opportunity: {{FUNDING_OPPORTUNITY}}
- Exact application prompt: {{EXACT_APPLICATION_PROMPT}}
- Word limit: {{WORD_LIMIT}}
- Who we will serve and how many: {{WHO_WE_WILL_SERVE_AND_HOW_MANY}}
- What we will actually do: {{WHAT_WE_WILL_ACTUALLY_DO}}
- Staffing: {{STAFFING}}
- Partners and their committed roles: {{PARTNERS_AND_THEIR_COMMITTED_ROLES}}
- Outcomes we are promising: {{OUTCOMES_WE_ARE_PROMISING}}
- Timeline: {{TIMELINE}}

Outline a community resource guide.
- Geographic area: {{GEOGRAPHIC_AREA}}
- Who will use it: {{STAFF_CLIENTS_BOTH}}
- Needs it should cover: {{NEEDS_IT_SHOULD_COVER}}
- Format: {{PRINTED_HANDOUT_INTERNAL_PDF_WEBSITE_PAGE}}
- Length limit: {{LENGTH_LIMIT}}
- Languages needed: {{LANGUAGES_NEEDED}}

Context:
- Source and citation: {{SOURCE_AND_CITATION}}
- Who has to comply day to day: {{WHO_HAS_TO_COMPLY_DAY_TO_DAY}}
- What we currently do: {{WHAT_WE_CURRENTLY_DO}}
- Effective date or deadline: {{EFFECTIVE_DATE_OR_DEADLINE}}

Write a decision memo.
- Audience: {{BOARD_EXECUTIVE_TEAM_COMMITTEE}}
- The decision being requested: {{THE_DECISION_BEING_REQUESTED}}
- Background they need: {{BACKGROUND_THEY_NEED}}
- Options considered: {{OPTIONS_CONSIDERED}}
- My recommendation and why: {{MY_RECOMMENDATION_AND_WHY}}
- Financial implications: {{FINANCIAL_IMPLICATIONS}}
- Risks of acting and of not acting: {{RISKS_OF_ACTING_AND_OF_NOT_ACTING}}
- Deadline for the decision: {{DEADLINE_FOR_THE_DECISION}}
- Page limit: {{PAGE_LIMIT}}

Write a budget narrative.
- Funder and program: {{FUNDER_AND_PROGRAM}}
- Total request: {{TOTAL_REQUEST}}
- Period of performance: {{PERIOD_OF_PERFORMANCE}}
- Budget lines with amounts: {{BUDGET_LINES_WITH_AMOUNTS}}
- How each figure was calculated: {{HOW_EACH_FIGURE_WAS_CALCULATED}}
- Indirect cost rate and basis: {{INDIRECT_COST_RATE_AND_BASIS}}
- Match or cost share required: {{MATCH_OR_COST_SHARE_REQUIRED}}
- Allowability rules or cost principles that apply: {{ALLOWABILITY_RULES_OR_COST_PRINCIPLES_THAT_APP}}

Write a message to a senior stakeholder.
- Recipient and their role: {{RECIPIENT_AND_THEIR_ROLE}}
- My role and organization: {{MY_ROLE_AND_ORGANIZATION}}
- The single thing I want them to know, do, or decide: {{THE_SINGLE_THING_I_WANT_THEM_TO_KNOW_DO_OR_DEC}}
- Relevant background they may not have: {{RELEVANT_BACKGROUND_THEY_MAY_NOT_HAVE}}
- Supporting facts or numbers: {{SUPPORTING_FACTS_OR_NUMBERS}}
- Political or relational sensitivities: {{POLITICAL_OR_RELATIONAL_SENSITIVITIES}}
